===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de|en}} {{m|de|Frankfurter|}}, the adjectival form of {{m|de|Frankfurt|}}. Specifically, a reference to [[Frankfurt-am-Main]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|UK|US|Canada}} A moist [[sausage]] of soft, even texture and flavor, often made from mechanically recovered meat or meat slurry.

